{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"423391c8432a506de95e75d113ee9b8b0f9fd44fbaeef0b5dea6cf0bce8f4966","ja":"秘密を打ち明ける歩さん","zh":"向步小姐坦白秘密","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bdd2323598391aa3a6d6bffb1546bcac6698d9ec792407c43b58799c340288e9","ja":"そ……そうそう！　そうなんだよ！\nきっとアタシの別人格とみんなが鉢合わせたんだ！","zh":"对……对对！就是那样！\n肯定是大家碰到了我的另一个人格！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"2efe0a47de2a56a017fdb02aa6df00a9004fd322eadc2c0d24be0c31bc5c2e9a","ja":"そうだったんですね……って、\nさすがにごまかされませんよ！","zh":"原来是这样啊……不对，\n我可不会轻易被你糊弄过去！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2a67da728233d06bcb6e7fea4b6ef1d3f920a59414a03de1e9a3c567a24b851e","ja":"そうだよ。\nわたし、そんなに子どもじゃないんだから！","zh":"就是说嘛。\n我又不是什么小孩子了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"89d5f2aaae6e808c31841637309db5b8a295f4f6223bd0b72816ed5bfdd562c3","ja":"歩、もう観念して正直に話した方がいいって思うな！\nいったいコソコソ何してたの？","zh":"步，我觉得你还是认命老实交代比较好哦！\n你到底在偷偷摸摸干什么呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"5b4cf55eed7ac2528c67e4343b99ff7418e08e59e1f4b8bfb7ca3ae11c387a70","ja":"うう……実は、みんなの好きなもの……\n探してたんだ。","zh":"呜呜……其实，我刚才是在……\n找大家喜欢的东西。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"e73e2a0549ec318e904a75a893e6a169e8ff78fe5c2d83b9087268fb5a586884","ja":"えっ……？　でも……ど、どうして……\n私たちには、秘密に……？","zh":"欸……？　可是……为、为什么……\n要对我们……保密呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"0793eb9f98cbde9cd3ad0443c990a5c1c601f59723d005665ab7ca0606992ad9","ja":"ほら、アタシって劇の中でみんなとたくさん\n掛け合いあったでしょ？","zh":"你看，我在剧中不是和大家有好多\n对手戏吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"39b3910cc75c09bcf542a07a2c0d885044bfbfc70f39f5a285af23f5e7def8ff","ja":"その上、複雑な役だから、台本の読み合わせも\nたくさん付き合ってもらってさ……。","zh":"而且因为角色很复杂，还拜托对方陪我\n对了好多次台词……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"280562c98c88b3eb92cd2676a391688216f02fcddeb45da76ed001010019c517","ja":"……だから！　こっそりみんなへのお礼の\nプレゼントを買いたかったんだ！","zh":"……所以说！我才想悄悄给大家买\n表达谢意的礼物的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"efb89cb0e173540fde9ab6c165083b11c552e169c2d480f3098b146307cd2cde","ja":"それで……。あのうどん屋さん\nお土産用の商品もたくさんありますもんね♪","zh":"所以……那家乌冬面店\n也有很多适合当伴手礼的商品呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"5c444b011afef781bd630fb878ed82b13e20b5a2c2a8ec798b20fcf4b254523d","ja":"じゃあわたしと会ったときも……\nプレゼントを探してくれてたんだ……！","zh":"那么和我碰面的时候也是……\n在帮我找礼物啊……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"6dfb52754c6e150863df0157a9ccc42dffae5e468594c80be4c2cc434b2d8424","ja":"うれしいです……ふふっ……♪","zh":"好开心……呵呵……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"d908eb69e1c7805597c8846292e174c187397b33027ae5f447b2c82f02c15c94","ja":"も～、みんなをびっくりさせたかったのに！\n計画めちゃくちゃだよ～！","zh":"真是的～，明明想吓大家一跳的！\n计划全都泡汤啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"81f589d8dbfea69c329a2be7b7c5513f6ff42452c73916704730f790b6111742","ja":"計画したわりには、\n歩、全員に見つかってるの！","zh":"明明做了周密的计划，\n步却被所有人发现了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"931747b250cb44736cb216697cf4f57b86b4a4e3821752859d81ec0ed5a00632","ja":"こうなったら～……ミキ、みんなで今から\nお買い物に行くといいって思うな☆","zh":"既然都这样了～……美希觉得大家现在\n一起去买东西会很不错呢☆","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"b14604af57ad6d037dda7f8eb1480977af1e2f896986386d20d97edae80f410a","ja":"……そうだな。それじゃあ\n堂々と正面から、みんなにお礼させてよ！","zh":"……也是呢。那就\n让我堂堂正正、光明正大地向大家道谢吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[53].text","source_sha256":"c6f553e27d2f95e489b468310402708a0b2d1dc652179661032e1e4fa00528b7","ja":"それだけじゃないよ。\nミキからも、歩に何かプレゼントするの☆","zh":"还不止这样哦。\n美希也要送步什么礼物☆","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[54].text","source_sha256":"546d335e925297c1d35bd2434194011642cc6bd0315c9eb66dcace7e0c33e5ab","ja":"えっ？　アタシに……？","zh":"咦？　给我……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[55].text","source_sha256":"8325ceef6e2675fae3d7bd3eadbed3889246a3eaa8b4ab373bc360f2b28137f9","ja":"その、私も……歩さんにはレッスンで\nお世話になったから……お礼、したいです……！","zh":"那个，我也……在练习时受到了\n步小姐的很多关照……所以想向她道谢……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1067.unity3d","item_key":"commands[56].text","source_sha256":"c1cbfe16c8c710df1bd46f63e9db4af1ccd82bb90c6d8ae8cfa351a92a2fea3f","ja":"……そっか、アタシもみんなの役に\n立ってたんだ……えへへへっ、サンキュー♪","zh":"……这样啊，原来我也帮上\n大家的忙了啊……嘿嘿嘿，谢啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
